   "text": "Let’s collect the traps, because the people who write the exam know every one of them."
  },
  {
   "i": 1,
   "start": 5.8,
   "speechStart": 5.8,
   "end": 7.325,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "Bearings."
  },
  {
   "i": 2,
   "start": 7.575,
   "speechStart": 7.575,
   "end": 11.575,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Use the deviation for the boat’s heading, not for the bearing."
  },
  {
   "i": 3,
   "start": 11.825,
   "speechStart": 11.825,
   "end": 13.325,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "Signs."
  },
  {
   "i": 4,
   "start": 13.575,
   "speechStart": 13.575,
   "end": 15.8,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Toward compass, add west."
  },
  {
   "i": 5,
   "start": 16.05,
   "speechStart": 16.05,
   "end": 18.1,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Toward true, add east."
  },
  {
   "i": 6,
   "start": 18.35,
   "speechStart": 18.35,
   "end": 19.925,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "The rose."
  },
  {
   "i": 7,
   "start": 20.175,
   "speechStart": 20.175,
   "end": 25.275,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Read the wrong side, and your answer is exactly one hundred eighty degrees off."
  },
  {
   "i": 8,
   "start": 25.525,
   "speechStart": 25.525,
   "end": 28.6,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "And will that wrong answer be among the choices?"
  },
  {
   "i": 9,
   "start": 28.85,
   "speechStart": 29.6,
   "end": 31.55,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Very often, yes."
  },
  {
   "i": 10,
   "start": 31.8,
   "speechStart": 31.8,
   "end": 35.575,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "Don’t mix true and magnetic in the same calculation."
  },
  {
   "i": 11,
   "start": 35.825,
   "speechStart": 35.825,
   "end": 37.775,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "Pick one and stay in it."
  },
  {
   "i": 12,
   "start": 38.025,
   "speechStart": 38.025,
   "end": 40.825,
   "builds": 1,
   "text": "And answer in what the question asks for."
  },
  {
   "i": 13,
   "start": 41.075,
   "speechStart": 41.075,
   "end": 45.35,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "If it says compass, a perfect true course is still a wrong answer."
  },
  {
   "i": 14,
   "start": 45.6,
   "speechStart": 45.6,
   "end": 47.5,
   "builds": 0,
   "text": "That’s lesson five."
  },
  {
